# SENTINEL RISK INTELLIGENCE - VENDOR RISK POLICY
Version: 2.1 (Last Updated: October 2022)

## 1. Vendor Onboarding
All new vendors must undergo a Tier 1 security assessment including:
- Data encryption standards (AES-256)
- SOC2 Type II compliance check
- Financial stability audit

## 2. Annual Reviews
Vendors with access to PII (Personally Identifiable Information) are subject to annual reviews every October.

## 3. Termination Policy
Termination of service requires 30-day notice and evidence of data destruction.

[SYSTEM NOTE: This policy is outdated. It does not include the Rajasthan Platform Based Gig Workers Act (2023) or the Digital Personal Data Protection Act (2023) requirements.]
